<title>JAPAN: Nintendo rises in anticipation of year-end sales.</title>
<headline>Nintendo rises in anticipation of year-end sales.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Nintendo Co Ltd rose in Monday morning trade on the Osaka Securities Exchange due to speculation the company's sales would increase because of demand related to the year-end, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0109 GMT, the shares were 60 yen higher at 7,700 yen.</p>
</text>
